    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύκιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dyer's buckthorn, Rhamnus
				petiolaris</i>, found in Cappadocia and Lycia, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.100
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				12.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἰνδικόν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογχῖτις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.216
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύκειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollon.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.616
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a decoction from</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.1
				</span></i>
			, used medicinally, ib. <i><span class="en">
				63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.2406.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
